    "changes": [
      "Kept the body, head, helmet and light-armour meshes that body_light.skin lists; dropped the weapons, the plane and the tag objects.",
      "Posed the armature with fixed bone angles (arms lowered to the sides, see the \"pose\" block) and applied the pose: a static mesh, no rig.",
      "Scaled to 1.80 m tall with the feet at height 0, and turned to face -Z; converted to one glTF binary.",
      "Materials rebuilt from the diffuse and normal maps: a non-metal of roughness 0.57. helmet_a.png is not used.",
      "The green channel of helmet_n.png and head_n.png is flipped to the OpenGL convention: a curl test of the maps found them in the DirectX convention, and base_n.png and armor_n.png in the OpenGL one."
